<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: Hilti sees 1996 net profit at 1995 level.</title>
<headline>Hilti sees 1996 net profit at 1995 level.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAAN, Liechtenstein 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction equipment group Hilti AG said it expected 1996 full-year net profit and cash flow to be about the same level as in the year before.</p>
<p>&quot;Excluding unexpected developments on financial and currency markets, Hilti expects a group net profit (1995: 193 million Swiss francs) and cash flow (1995: 310 million) at the high level of last year,&quot; a Hilti statement said.</p>
</text>
